<title>USA: OfficeMax Q1 same-store sales up five pct.</title>
<headline>OfficeMax Q1 same-store sales up five pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $888.6     $730.6	  22	    5</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Quarter is   13 weeks ended	April 26.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			     OfficeMax Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Same-store sales for the quarter rose five percent on top of the 15 percent registered a year before.</p>
</text>
